Package: trama.documentos
Title: Living Documents for trama Analyses
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Pedro", "Mambelli Fernandes", , "pedromambelli@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Turns a trama analysis into a finished document: a Quarto file
    of the project where the text belongs to the author and managed regions
    belong to trama. Results of flow nodes are materialized next to the
    document (tables, figures, sanitized models, tests) and referenced by
    regions that are refreshed when the analysis changes, without ever
    touching the author's text. Documents start from Quarto extension
    templates (a gallery to create, edit, duplicate, import and export them,
    with built-in academic ABNT, consulting report, article, slides and
    dashboard templates) and author profiles, and render locally to HTML,
    PDF (Typst), Word, revealjs slides and dashboards. Charts follow a light
    theme derived from the template's brand. It is a trama plugin, not a
    block collection: it has no nodes.
